area: config
case: 39-lax-float-exp
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: config
reason: the port refuses a quoted number the oracle coerces: a TOML value must be the type the key declares — an integer is accepted for a float and a fractionless float for an integer, because TOML spells one number two ways — and D-E in plans/duplication-and-simplification-plan.md records why: a quoted number in a config file is a typo, and the port reports it at startup instead of re-typing it. The extractor-default difference every other config golden records is folded into the refusal.
--- oracle
default=-
permitted=-
providers_defaulted=true
enabled=exa:free,freeserp,parallel:free
effective=exa:free,freeserp,parallel:free
free_only=true
missing_keys=
missing_agent=
policy,500,2000,10.000000
fetch,true,trafilatura,100.000000,8388608,40000,200,6000,3,false,false,seekwright/0.1.1 (+https://github.com/leoschwarz/seekwright),-,false,http,-,-,-,60.000000,-,268435456,33554432,300.000000
search,-,-,60.000000,3,120.000000
agent,false,-,-,90.000000,30.000000,24000,500,2500,0.250000,-,-
logging,INFO,text,WARNING,false,false,false
dashboard,true,-
provider exa:free enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
provider freeserp enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
provider parallel:free enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
--- port
ERR fetch.timeout_seconds: expected a number, found '1e2'
